   6>Instructions :
   ----------------

_joy0state:       Give you the state of joystick in port 0
               In :  /
               Out   :  d0.b
_joy1state:       Same as precednet but for joystick in port 1
               In :  /
               Out   :  d0.b
_joy0fire1:
_joy0fire2:
_joy0fire3:       These 3 functions give you the state of any
               fire buttons on joystick in mouse port.
               ( Can check mouse buttons if mouse is connected )
               In :  /
               Out   :  d0.b
_joy1fire1:
_joy1fire2:
_joy1fire3:       These 3 functions give you the state of any
               fire buttons on joystick in joystick port.
               ( Can check mouse buttons if mouse is connected )
               In :  /
               Out   :  d0.b
_arrowkeysstate:  Give you if any of arrow keys is pressed.
               In :  /
               Out   :  d0.b

Out register d0 is organized like this for directions testing :
   Bit   #0 =  Up
      #1 =  Down
      #2 =  Left
      #3 =  Right
